                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15093287" author="vkulichenko" created="Tue, 12 Jan 2016 04:45:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We should also revisit all other usages of warning logging with exceptions.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15093482" author="yzhdanov" created="Tue, 12 Jan 2016 07:43:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Here is the sample printout:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;03:45:14,763&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;WARNING&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#47%null%&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;flusher-0-#47%null%&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GridCacheWriteBehindStore&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Unable to update underlying store: o.a.i.cache.store.jdbc.CacheJdbcPojoStore@7d721f3&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should also fix toString() for all stores provided.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15729091" author="agura" created="Wed, 7 Dec 2016 15:58:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Exception traces logging are already fixed (see &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3770&quot; title=&quot;GridLogThrottle.warn ignores the exception&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-3770&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-3770&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;). So only provided store implementations should be fixed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15729478" author="agura" created="Wed, 7 Dec 2016 18:24:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;toString()&lt;/tt&gt; method added to all non-test cache store implementations except of &lt;tt&gt;PlatformDotNetCacheStore&lt;/tt&gt;. PR created: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1329&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1329&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15732026" author="sboikov" created="Thu, 8 Dec 2016 12:06:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks ok, but &apos;toString&apos; should be placed at the end of classes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
